### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = change-me-to-a-long-random-string

### Target Router Variables (Bisa diubah ke IP mana saja, e.g. 192.168.88.1 atau ath.vpnbersama.us)
@routerHost = ath.vpnbersama.us
@routerPort = 51121
@routerUser = admin
@routerPass = password_anda

### 1. Health Check (Tanpa Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Universal System Resource (CPU, Uptime, Memory)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/resource
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "router": {
    "host": "{{routerHost}}",
    "port": {{routerPort}},
    "user": "{{routerUser}}",
    "password": "{{routerPass}}"
  }
}

### 3. Universal Get Identity Router (Menggunakan Header X-Router-*)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/identity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4. Check for RouterOS Updates
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/check-update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. IPv4 Addresses List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ip/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filter": {
    "?disabled": "no"
  }
}

### 6. IPv6 Addresses List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ipv6/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. DHCP Leases List (Perangkat Lokal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dhcp/leases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Hotspot Voucher List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotspot/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 9. Hotspot Create Voucher Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotspot/user/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "vc_member_01",
  "password": "secretpassword",
  "profile": "default",
  "timelimit": "3h",
  "comment": "Dibuat via Universal Gateway"
}

### 10. Hotspot Active Users (Sedang Online)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/hotspot/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11. PPPoE Secrets List
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ppp/secrets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 12. Firewall Block IP (Masukkan ke Address List)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/firewall/block-ip
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "198.51.100.25",
  "list": "BLACKLIST_ATTACK",
  "timeout": "1d",
  "comment": "Brute force attack"
}

### 13. Simple Queue List (Bandwidth Limiter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/queues/simple
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Router-Host: {{routerHost}}
X-Router-Port: {{routerPort}}
X-Router-User: {{routerUser}}
X-Router-Pass: {{routerPass}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 14. Universal Raw Command Runner (Perintah Bebas Apa Saja)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/command
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "router": {
    "host": "{{routerHost}}",
    "port": {{routerPort}},
    "user": "{{routerUser}}",
    "password": "{{routerPass}}"
  },
  "command": "/tool/ping",
  "args": {
    "address": "8.8.8.8",
    "count": "3"
  }
}

### 15. Realtime Traffic Streaming (SSE) - Buka di browser / SSE client
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/interfaces/stream?host={{routerHost}}&port={{routerPort}}&user={{routerUser}}&password={{routerPass}}&interface=ether1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream
